	(descr "SCHURTER SCPC Case WS17 prismatic supercapacitor (P/N 3-153-438), 1.0 F 2.75 V, ESR 40 mOhm. Flat prismatic cell 28.5 x 17.0 mm, 1.70 mm max thick. Under-body solder pads only: N 12.25 x 3.5 and P 7.75 x 3.5, centred +/-11.0 mm from cell centre (outer edge 1.5 mm in from each end). Asymmetric pad widths are the polarity key (N wider than P). The end tabs (drawn on F.Fab, ~2.75 mm past each end) are finish-coated locators, NOT solder pads. Pads are byte-identical to the locked embedded land (solarglow:SC1); this bordered version only ADDS the F.Fab body, locator tabs, and courtyard so DRC/visual can catch encroaching parts.")
